ortant slide in  in many ways because a lot of people  don't understand that cloud hosted is  not the same as pure cloud so a lot of  systems have been taken that were built  for on-premises there in you  the rooms have now been moved to the  cloud and it really hasn't been that's  not a digital transformation you're  taking a digitalized or a digitized  system a system that digitized your lab  and you're moving it into the cloud but  it's just really moving I don't want to  say moving the problem these are good  systems and a lot of cases but you're  not really getting that access to the  pure cloud technologies  unless it's architected for the cloud  and then you can have that data  aggregation system that has access to  all of these cloud technology such as  artificial intelligence machine learning  mobile services and IOT devices and  things like that so that's what we call  cloud enhance so I love the metaphor of  the cloud because the clouds are  constantly changing you look up in the  sky and you see everything changing but  the clouds themselves are actually  constantly changing and getting more and  more and more technologically capable  and this is where that transformation  from then over the next ten years as  digital technologies begin to double  again you will get that access to that  through these clouds so just be a little  bit cautious about what kind of cloud  systems you adopt so why do we need to  make data fly in formation this is the  crux of this question today we talked  about the the digital the you know  bookending it again with you know  technology doubling and robots coming  into play and you know this is this  whole digital transformation that we're  talking about and artificial  intelligence algorithms becoming your  partners in the research lab so we need  to make the data ready for the future  and we need to make our labs ready for  the future and if we don't it's sort of  the same old thinking same old result so  we've seen since 2010 the return on  investment drop from ten percent down to  three percent 2017 this is a precipitous  drop and we need to start looking at  digitalization and artificial  intelligence and things like that  in order to help improve that ROI so our  company Rock step solutions is  digitalizing the animal lab and really  moving into other areas of research as  well so I want to thank you for taking  the time I want to thank Julie for being  here and given a great present being  part of this presentation and we're  gonna take any questions after I think  through email and and thank you very  much really appreciate this Thank You  Chuck and Julie for your informative  presentations I would also like to thank  lab roots for making today's educational  webcast possible before we go I want to  let everyone know that this webcast will  be available for on-demand viewing  through May 14 to 2019 as a final  reminder our speakers will follow up  with any questions you've submitted via  email that's all for now thank you for  joining us and we will see you next time  goodbye
 

